@startuml pack-write-model
' Sources:
'   contracts/packs/schemas/{pack-descriptor,graph-shard,org-fragment,asset}.schema.json
'   contracts/packs/file-kinds.yaml (node kinds, fragment kind vocabulary)
'   service/kernel (kernel.domain): PackDescriptor, DrgNode, DrgEdge, Relation, PackLevel
'   Decided design: ADR-0048 (composition), ADR-0049 (glossary), ADR-0050 (mission types, lifecycles, gates),
'   ADR-0051 (event registry), ADR-0052 (anti-patterns). Accepted 2026-11-02; none of it is built yet.
' Edges carry no provenance: it is not authored and the schema refuses it (ADR-0017, DIV-019); a shard node may.
' charter.schema.json validates the project's charter.yaml, not a pack file, so it is not drawn.
' Notation: + required, - optional, [0..1] / [0..*] multiplicity.
' Pending: a yellow <<pending>> class or a [pending ADR-00xx OQn] suffix marks a part whose open question is not ruled.
!include _style.iuml
left to right direction
title Pack write model — decided design (ADR-0048…ADR-0052)

class Pack <<directory>> {
  one per Charter Pack
}
class PackDescriptor <<pack.yaml>> {
  + pack_id : string [ULID pattern, ADR-0048 Consequences]
  + pack_version : string [every level]
  + name : string
  - parent_pack : string [ULID pattern; lineage only, sets no load order]
  - depends_on : DependsOn[]
  - pack_level : PackLevel <color:#8A6D00>[pending ADR-0048 OQ7: required?]</color>
  - requires_core : string [PEP 440]
  - pack_drg : path
  unknown keys : refused (additionalProperties: false)
}
class DependsOn <<item of depends_on>> {
  + pack_id : string [ULID]
  + range : string <color:#8A6D00>[pending ADR-0048 OQ4: grammar]</color>
}
enum PackLevel {
  built-in
  org
  project
}
class GraphShard <<*.graph.yaml>> {
  + schema_version : "1.0"
  + generated_at : string
  - generated_by : string
}
class OrgFragment <<drg/fragment.yaml>> {
  required for org packs
  no header fields
}
class ShardNode {
  + urn : Urn
  + kind : NodeKind
  - label : string
  - provenance : string
  - tags : string[]
  anti_pattern node with no file : refused after migration <color:#8A6D00>[pending ADR-0052 OQ3]</color>
}
class FragmentNode {
  + id : string
  + kind : FragmentKind
  - title : string
  - body_path : path
}
class Edge {
  + source : Urn
  + target : Urn
  + relation : Relation
  - reason : string
  - when : string [shards only]
  - impacts : number [-1..1, only on impacts]
}
class ArtifactFile <<*.directive.yaml, *.tactic.yaml, *.styleguide.yaml, *.toolguide.yaml, *.paradigm.yaml, *.procedure.yaml, *.agent.yaml>> {
  + id : string [profile-id for *.agent.yaml]
  one schema per kind
}
class GlossaryFile <<pending>> {
  glossaries/<context-id>.glossary.yaml
  one glossary context per file, terms inside <color:#8A6D00>[pending ADR-0049 OQ1: layout]</color>
}
class AntiPatternFile <<pending>> {
  anti_patterns/<id>.anti-pattern.yaml
  severity : smell | severe | breaking
  migrated entries default to smell <color:#8A6D00>[pending ADR-0052 OQ4]</color>
  shape and layout <color:#8A6D00>[pending ADR-0052 OQ2]</color>
}
class LifecycleFile <<pending>> {
  lifecycles/<id>.lifecycle.yaml
  a reusable state machine
  layout and shape <color:#8A6D00>[pending ADR-0050 OQ4]</color>
}
class GateFile <<pending>> {
  gates/<id>.gate.yaml
  severity, config_schema
  the gate kind <color:#8A6D00>[pending ADR-0050 OQ2]</color>
}
class EventRegistryFile <<pending>> {
  event_registries/<id>.event-registry.yaml
  event types only
  layout; not a CRG node <color:#8A6D00>[pending ADR-0051 OQ3]</color>
}
class MissionTypeBundle <<directory>> {
  mission_types/<type>/
  <type>.mission-type.yaml
  steps/<step>.prompt.md
  steps/<step>.guidelines.md
  step_contracts/<id>.step-contract.yaml
  templates/...
}
class StepEnhancementFile <<pending>> {
  enhancements/<id>.step-enhancement.yaml
  target : action:<type>/<step>
  authored in the enhancing pack <color:#8A6D00>[pending ADR-0050 OQ8]</color>
}
class AssetManifest <<*.asset.yaml>> {
  + id : string
  + path : path [inside assets/]
  + mime : string
  - title : string
}
enum FragmentKind {
  directives, tactics, styleguides, toolguides
  paradigms, procedures, agent_profiles
  mission_step_contracts, skills
  assets, templates, mission_types, actions
  lifecycles
  <glossary plural> (not spelled by ADR-0049; follow-up #114)
  anti_patterns <color:#8A6D00>[pending ADR-0052 OQ3: file-less nodes]</color>
  gates <color:#8A6D00>[pending ADR-0050 OQ2]</color>
  event_registries <color:#8A6D00>[pending ADR-0051 OQ3]</color>
}

Pack "1" *-- "0..1" PackDescriptor
Pack "1" *-- "0..*" GraphShard
Pack "1" *-- "0..1" OrgFragment : org packs: 1
Pack "1" *-- "0..*" ArtifactFile
Pack "1" *-- "0..*" GlossaryFile
Pack "1" *-- "0..*" AntiPatternFile
Pack "1" *-- "0..*" LifecycleFile
Pack "1" *-- "0..*" GateFile
Pack "1" *-- "0..*" EventRegistryFile
Pack "1" *-- "0..*" MissionTypeBundle
MissionTypeBundle "1" *-- "0..*" StepEnhancementFile
Pack "1" *-- "0..*" AssetManifest
PackDescriptor "1" *-- "0..*" DependsOn
PackDescriptor ..> PackLevel
GraphShard "1" *-- "0..*" ShardNode
GraphShard "1" *-- "0..*" Edge
OrgFragment "1" *-- "0..*" FragmentNode
OrgFragment "1" *-- "0..*" Edge
FragmentNode ..> FragmentKind

note right of PackDescriptor
  Composition (ADR-0048). built-in is a distribution pack:
  it holds no artifacts and aggregates members through depends_on (d12).
  A member carries parent_pack: null (d15).
  A specialist pack only adds; a sibling conflict is refused (d9).
  Level rule: pack_level may not exceed the parent's (d7). <color:#8A6D00>[pending ADR-0048 OQ7]</color>
  What a compose is <color:#8A6D00>[pending ADR-0048 OQ6]</color>
end note

note bottom of PackLevel
  Level of our own opt-in packs (java, qa, ...):
  org, or a new level? <color:#8A6D00>[pending ADR-0048 OQ1]</color>
end note

note bottom of Edge
  A sibling conflict is settled by the distribution pack's
  own overrides edge, naming the winner. <color:#8A6D00>[pending ADR-0048 OQ5]</color>
end note

note bottom of FragmentKind
  One name per concept (R14):
  mission_step_contracts, not mission_steps;
  mission_types, not mission_type.
  Refused: mission_steps, mission_type, glossary_scope.
end note

legend right
  Yellow <<pending>> / [pending …]: decided in the cited ADR,
  but the cited open question is not ruled.
endlegend
@enduml
